// P3D.2 (IR2, IR6.2–IR6.5, X1, X2): the Constraint manager on the inspection stand-in
// (`inspection` set-up command, `cadrs_core::samples::inspection`: a ring (Sketch 1 /
// Extrude 1, Fillet 1) and a tab (Sketch 2 / Extrude 2) whose Sketch 2 uses the ring's outer
// bottom edge (Ø30) and has a circle dimensioned Ø18 made concentric and Equal to it, and
// doesn't close).
// 01 the broken Part Studio (IR5.1, IR6.1): Sketch 2 and Extrude 2 red with their ⓘ, the red "!"
//    on the Features header.
// 02 Sketch 2 edited (IR6.2, IR5.3, IR5.4): the yellow "Sketch could not be solved." beside the
//    dialog, whose title is red; the conflicting circle red; the Part Studio rolled back to
//    Sketch 2 (Extrude 2 grey, italic and not built, the rollback bar under Sketch 2); Final
//    next to the diagnostics icon.
// 03 the footer's "Show sketch diagnostic tools" icon: Profile inspector… / Constraint
//    manager… (IR1.2, IR6.3).
// 04 the Constraint manager under the dialog (IR2.1–IR2.5): Filters (the "Automatically select
//    constraints" switch, the Type grid, Mode, Status), Sort by constraint / Sort by entity, and
//    every constraint with its entities under it: the shared corners (Coincident 1–3, their
//    trash greyed: coincident by construction; Coincident 4 the circles' shared center, "[Extrude
//    1]" as one is projected), Use 1 with its source in brackets, Diameter 1, Concentric 1,
//    Equal 1 …; the list takes the panel's height and scrolls; Delete all.
// 05 Status → Errors (IR6.4, IR2.6): the whole conflicting set, bold red: "Equal 1 [Extrude 1]"
//    and "Diameter 1" (removing either lets the sketch solve).
// 06 hovering Equal 1 lights up its two circles with a thick orange band over the red, and its
//    two glyphs turn orange (IR2.6).
// 07 Sort by entity (IR2.4): Circle 1 and Circle 2, each with its conflicting constraints under
//    it.
// 08 back to Sort by constraint; Equal 1's trash (IR6.5): the list is empty, Delete all greys
//    out, the Ø18 holds, the circles turn black, the toast goes and the title is black again.
// 09 Errors off, Type → Coincident only: the three shared corners.
// 10 "Automatically select constraints" off with the tab's top line selected: only the
//    constraints of the selection (the two corners on that line) (IR2.3).
// 11 switch back on, Type → Use and Diameter: Use 1 and Diameter 1; Delete all removes both in
//    one step (IR2.7): the projected circle turns blue (free), the Ø18 goes.
// 12 Ctrl+Z: both are back (one undo step).
// 13 the × closes the panel.
Scenario(
    start: Some("document"),
    steps: [
        WaitFor("document-shell"),
        Custom("inspection"),
        Key("P"),
        Key("Shift+7"),
        Key("F"),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("01-broken"),
        RightClick(ui("feature-sketch-2")),
        WaitFor("feature-context-menu"),
        Click(ui("feature-edit")),
        WaitFor("sketch-dialog"),
        Custom("view 0 90 13 3 0 0.055"),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("02-sketch-not-solved"),
        Click(ui("sketch-diagnostics")),
        WaitFor("sketch-diag-menu"),
        Hover(ui("sketch-diag-constraints")),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("03-diagnostics-menu"),
        Click(ui("sketch-diag-constraints")),
        WaitFor("constraint-manager"),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("04-constraint-manager"),
        Click(ui("cm-status-errors")),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("05-errors-filter"),
        Hover(ui("cm-row-equal-1")),
        Wait(10),
        Screenshot("06-hover-highlights"),
        Click(ui("cm-sort-1")),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("07-sort-by-entity"),
        Click(ui("cm-sort-0")),
        Click(ui("cm-row-equal-1-delete")),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("08-equal-deleted"),
        Click(ui("cm-status-errors")),
        Click(ui("cm-type-coincident")),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("09-type-coincident"),
        ClickWorld(26, 5),
        Click(ui("cm-auto-select")),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("10-selection-only"),
        Click(ui("cm-auto-select")),
        Click(ui("cm-type-coincident")),
        Click(ui("cm-type-use")),
        Click(ui("cm-type-diameter")),
        Click(ui("cm-delete-all")),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("11-delete-all"),
        Key("Ctrl+Z"),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("12-undone"),
        Click(ui("constraint-manager-close")),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("13-closed"),
    ],
)
